		{"id":"9c6bb3bff5a9fdff","type":"group","x":4640,"y":3295,"width":900,"height":285,"color":"1","label":"🖥️ Box Overview"},
		{"id":"35ae6a8b2c7effc4","type":"group","x":200,"y":-497,"width":290,"height":189,"label":"TCP - open"},
		{"id":"01c750d1c64ceb00","type":"text","text":"## nmap\n```\nPORT STATE SERVICE VERSION  \n22/tcp open ssh OpenSSH 7.6p1 Ubuntu 4ubuntu0.3 (Ubuntu Linux; protocol 2.0)  \n| ssh-hostkey:  \n| 2048 20:d1:ed:84:cc:68:a5:a7:86:f0:da:b8:92:3f:d9:67 (RSA)  \n| 256 78:89:b3:a2:75:12:76:92:2a:f9:8d:27:c1:08:a7:b9 (ECDSA)  \n|_ 256 b8:f4:d6:61:cf:16:90:c5:07:18:99:b0:7c:70:fd:c0 (ED25519)  \n80/tcp open http Apache httpd 2.4.29 ((Ubuntu))  \n|_http-server-header: Apache/2.4.29 (Ubuntu)  \n|_http-title: Apache2 Ubuntu Default Page: It works  \nService Info: OS: Linux; CPE: cpe:/o:linux:linux_kernel  \n  \nService detection performed. Please report any incorrect results at https://nmap.org/submit/ .  \nNmap done: 1 IP address (1 host up) scanned in 31.68 second\n```","x":-730,"y":-220,"width":594,"height":500},
